{"video":"rYW9nmr6a8o","lines":[{"t":[0,8.5],"en":"Now we're in Antarctica!"},{"t":[8.5,10],"en":"It's raining ice!"},{"t":[10,11.5],"en":"You just saw a penguin."},{"t":[11.5,14.4],"en":"He looks like a little butler, but you can't talk to him."},{"t":[14.4,16.4],"en":"Do I have time to use the bathroom?"},{"t":[16.4,17.2],"en":"None!"},{"t":[17.2,18.4],"en":"Pee as you run, Carly!"},{"t":[18.4,21.4],"en":"Pee as you run!"},{"t":[21.4,26.2],"en":"OK, my Reese's Pieces, after four emergency alterations"},{"t":[26.2,29],"en":"and several renditions of a cappella respect,"},{"t":[29,31.3],"en":"are y'all finally ready?"},{"t":[31.3,32.8],"en":"We are!"},{"t":[32.8,33.8],"en":"Woo!"},{"t":[33.8,37.8],"en":"And we look spectacular!"},{"t":[37.8,39.9],"en":"Honey, you turned us out."},{"t":[42.4,48],"en":"I am a Christmas ba-- jingle!"},{"t":[48,50],"en":"Whoever said Harper couldn't pull this off"},{"t":[50,53],"en":"was seriously misguided."},{"t":[53,56.7],"en":"But ladies, we could go on and on about how I masterfully"},{"t":[56.7,58.7],"en":"wove you into the fabric of the Witherspoon"},{"t":[58.7,60],"en":"cinematic universe."},{"t":[60,62.1],"en":"But if you don't get going, you'll miss drag night."},{"t":[62.1,66.8],"en":"Oh, drag night!"},{"t":[66.8,68.7],"en":"Was canceled."},{"t":[68.7,70.5],"en":"Yeah, the emcee called two hours ago."},{"t":[70.5,71.5],"en":"The club was sold."},{"t":[71.5,75.9],"en":"It's becoming a baby gap."},{"t":[75.9,78.5],"en":"So all this work was for nothing?"},{"t":[78.5,80.9],"en":"Wait, why did y'all make that grand entrance?"},{"t":[80.9,81.8],"en":"It's in our nature."},{"t":[81.8,82.8],"en":"No."},{"t":[82.8,94.7],"en":"You know who wouldn't stand for this?"},{"t":[94.7,96.2],"en":"Reese Witherspoon."},{"t":[96.2,103.7],"en":"You're going to have that drag night, even if I have to bend and snap somebody's neck."},{"t":[103.7,109.4],"en":"We're going to the audition in a limo?"},{"t":[109.4,110.4],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[110.4,111.9],"en":"That way we get there faster."},{"t":[111.9,112.8],"en":"It's a longer car."},{"t":[112.8,113.7],"en":"The math works."},{"t":[113.7,116.1],"en":"Well, why are we sitting in the front?"},{"t":[116.1,117.5],"en":"So we get there sooner."},{"t":[117.5,118],"en":"Keep up!"},{"t":[118,120],"en":"Hi, I'm Carly."},{"t":[120,121],"en":"I'm Raul."},{"t":[121,124.9],"en":"Can you believe it's my first day and I get to chauffeur a celebrity?"},{"t":[124.9,125.7],"en":"First day?"},{"t":[125.7,128.6],"en":"My wife made sandwiches."},{"t":[128.6,133.1],"en":"If you like egg salad with the freaking perfect amount of dill, you're in for a treat."},{"t":[133.1,137.1],"en":"Raul, I'm going to need you to drive like you just realized you forgot your wife's sandwiches"},{"t":[137.1,138.1],"en":"at home."},{"t":[138.1,139.1],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[139.1,140.1],"en":"This is too real."},{"t":[140.1,141.1],"en":"You can do this, Raul."},{"t":[141.1,142.1],"en":"Okay!"},{"t":[142.1,145.1],"en":"I can't believe I'm really in a limo!"},{"t":[145.1,146.1],"en":"Whee!"},{"t":[146.1,151.3],"en":"You will arrive at your destination in 17 minutes."},{"t":[151.3,153.2],"en":"In half a mile, turn right."},{"t":[153.2,154.2],"en":"You know what, Raul?"},{"t":[154.2,155.2],"en":"Hang a left up here."},{"t":[155.2,156.2],"en":"Cut."},{"t":[156.2,157.2],"en":"What?"},{"t":[157.2,158.2],"en":"No."},{"t":[158.2,159.2],"en":"The GPS literally says--"},{"t":[159.2,160.2],"en":"New route detected."},{"t":[160.2,162.2],"en":"You will arrive in 23 minutes."},{"t":[162.2,163.2],"en":"Ooh."},{"t":[163.2,164.2],"en":"More time in the limo."},{"t":[164.2,165.2],"en":"Spencer."},{"t":[165.2,166.2],"en":"It's okay."},{"t":[166.2,167.2],"en":"It's okay."},{"t":[167.2,168.2],"en":"Uh, hey, turn right."},{"t":[168.2,169.2],"en":"Turning right."},{"t":[169.2,171.2],"en":"You will arrive in 31 minutes."},{"t":[171.2,173.2],"en":"Raul, just stop listening to Spencer."},{"t":[173.2,174.2],"en":"Take the freeway."},{"t":[174.2,175.2],"en":"No."},{"t":[175.2,176.2],"en":"Raul, stop listening to Carly."},{"t":[176.2,177.2],"en":"She's always wrong."},{"t":[177.2,178.2],"en":"A little bit about me."},{"t":[178.2,180.2],"en":"Conflict really exacerbates my eczema."},{"t":[180.2,182.2],"en":"Can't wonder you passing my skin ointment."},{"t":[182.2,184.6],"en":"It's right next to the egg salad."},{"t":[184.6,186.6],"en":"Can we please just take the freeway?"},{"t":[186.6,187.6],"en":"It's faster."},{"t":[187.6,188.6],"en":"The on-ramp is on the right."},{"t":[188.6,189.6],"en":"No, take Ballard Bridge."},{"t":[189.6,190.6],"en":"We can make up the time we lost."},{"t":[190.6,191.6],"en":"Turn left."},{"t":[191.6,193.6],"en":"Could you just listen to me for once?"},{"t":[193.6,194.6],"en":"Left or right?"},{"t":[194.6,195.6],"en":"Right!"},{"t":[195.6,196.6],"en":"Raul, turn left right now!"},{"t":[196.6,197.6],"en":"Why'd we stop?"},{"t":[197.6,198.6],"en":"What's happening?"},{"t":[198.6,199.6],"en":"Ballard Bridge."},{"t":[199.6,200.6],"en":"Raised for ferry crossing."},{"t":[200.6,201.6],"en":"You will arrive in 57 minutes."},{"t":[201.6,202.6],"en":"Oh, my God."},{"t":[202.6,205.6],"en":"The bridge is gonna split in half!"},{"t":[205.6,209.6],"en":"Raul, here's your ointment."},{"t":[209.6,222.6],"en":"Spencer Shay!"},{"t":[222.6,223.6],"en":"Carly Shay!"},{"t":[223.6,224.6],"en":"We're here."},{"t":[224.6,225.6],"en":"We made it."},{"t":[225.6,228.6],"en":"Oh, the audition challenge started 20 minutes ago."},{"t":[228.6,230.6],"en":"I'm so sorry you've been disqualified."},{"t":[230.6,233.6],"en":"You are known after all I did to get here."},{"t":[233.6,235.6],"en":"It's over just like that?"},{"t":[235.6,241.6],"en":"You were actually able to skip most of the audition process because you're famous?"},{"t":[241.6,243.6],"en":"I acknowledge my privilege."},{"t":[243.6,245.6],"en":"I hate to say it, Carly, but it's all your fault."},{"t":[245.6,246.6],"en":"Thank you for apologizing."},{"t":[246.6,248.6],"en":"My fault?"},{"t":[248.6,249.6],"en":"You ignored the GPS."},{"t":[249.6,251.6],"en":"Yeah, what does a GPS know that I don't?"},{"t":[251.6,252.6],"en":"Everything!"},{"t":[252.6,255.6],"en":"It knows everything!"},{"t":[259.6,260.6],"en":"Is that a flick?"},{"t":[268.6,269.6],"en":"Guys, guys, guys!"},{"t":[269.6,273.6],"en":"We are loving this sibling rivalry."},{"t":[273.6,275.6],"en":"We want you back in the challenge."},{"t":[275.6,277.6],"en":"And I want you in my bed."},{"t":[277.6,278.6],"en":"Oh, whoa."},{"t":[278.6,281.6],"en":"That was highly inappropriate."},{"t":[281.6,283.6],"en":"But I meant to."},{"t":[284.6,285.6],"en":"You know what? You can take him."},{"t":[285.6,287.6],"en":"I can't deal with him anymore."},{"t":[287.6,288.6],"en":"Oh, I know this is raw."},{"t":[288.6,290.6],"en":"I know this is painful."},{"t":[290.6,294.6],"en":"I do need you to save it for the cameras."},{"t":[294.6,295.6],"en":"You're out."},{"t":[295.6,298.6],"en":"You're a content creator, right?"},{"t":[298.6,304.6],"en":"Some contestants on our show get more than a million new followers."},{"t":[304.6,307.6],"en":"Let's do a challenge, bro."},{"t":[307.6,309.6],"en":"So, it's pretty simple."},{"t":[309.6,314.6],"en":"Just slingshot a melon to knock over a target and you qualify for the race."},{"t":[314.6,317.6],"en":"Is that target a mom with a baby?"},{"t":[317.6,321.6],"en":"Yeah, the fire department uses these to practice rescues."},{"t":[322.6,324.6],"en":"So, which one of you is flinging fruit?"},{"t":[324.6,325.6],"en":"I am."},{"t":[325.6,326.6],"en":"Fine!"},{"t":[327.6,329.6],"en":"I'll save my melon skills for later."},{"t":[338.6,339.6],"en":"No!"},{"t":[339.6,340.6],"en":"Did I hit a target?"},{"t":[340.6,341.6],"en":"No!"},{"t":[341.6,343.6],"en":"You hit my coworker, Benjamin!"},{"t":[343.6,345.6],"en":"Hey, I'm Miranda Cosgrove from iCarly."},{"t":[345.6,346.6],"en":"Thanks for watching."},{"t":[346.6,348.6],"en":"Make sure that you like and subscribe."}]}
